{'symbol': 'ED', 'date': '2022-11-17 14:32:00', 'title': 'CON EDISON WINS RELIABILITYONE® AWARDS FOR RELIABLE SERVICE, TECHNOLOGY DEVELOPMENT', 'text': "VETERAN EMPLOYEE IS NAMED COMPANY'S OUTSTANDING CONTRIBUTOR NEW YORK , NOV. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CON EDISON HAS EARNED AWARDS FROM PA CONSULTING FOR PROVIDING RELIABLE ELECTRIC SERVICE AND FOR ITS DEVELOPMENT OF NEW TECHNOLOGY. THE COMPANY WON THE 2022 RELIABILITYONE® AWARD FOR OUTSTANDING RELIABILITY PERFORMANCE IN THE NORTHEAST METROPOLITAN SERVICE AREA AND THE OUTSTANDING TECHNOLOGY & INNOVATION AWARD."}